{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Lord Fenrir\u2019s Banquet!</strong><br>Now, now\u2014Lord Fenrir is waiting, stomach growling with anticipation!<br>Please, take your time and enjoy this feast to the fullest tonight...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, throw a carrot onto the stage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move the carrot near a rabbit, it will come closer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the rabbit to Lord Fenrir.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the rabbit to Lord Fenrir to increase your score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up When the Gauge Is Full</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the on-screen gauge reaches MAX, you'll power up!<br>Carrots will become enhanced for a limited time, drawing rabbits from farther away.<br>Feeding multiple rabbits to Lord Fenrir at once is the key to charging the gauge faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Rabbits Appear as You Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing each stage, achieving a high enough score will level you up!<br>As you level up, more rabbits will appear on the stage, allowing you to aim for even higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game supports mouse, keyboard, and controller input.</i></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hungry Picnic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835530/9903e7dbf0dd4a27896c422b4f77d723e9c89b9c.jpg"},{"name":"Full Picnic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835530/fab0da081b14f43e702f583950aab88f59b48337.jpg"},{"name":"Picnic Glutton","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835530/7a0e831030f4ebc8de6c3fae4ca3945dcc9d897c.jpg"},{"name":"Hungry Old Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi